Adapted files (each file's own header has the full detail):

- scripts/process_data.py — adapted from
  examples/cfd/external_aerodynamics/domino_nim_finetuning/src/process_data.py.
  Reads config from this project's own configs/ layout, and explicitly wires
  cfg.variables.global_parameters through (the original silently relied on
  DrivAerML-specific defaults that would have been wrong for AhmedML).

- scripts/openfoam_datapipe.py — adapted from the same example's
  openfoam_datapipe.py. Only change: added an "ahmedml" dataset kind pointing
  at the AhmedML dataset's raw file layout. The output schema is otherwise
  unmodified official code.

All other files in this repository (configs/, manifests/, scripts/pipeline_500.sh,
scripts/run_prediction.sh, scripts/batch_eval_10.py, scripts/batch_eval_50.sh) are
original to this project, not derived from PhysicsNeMo.
